&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
